 <characteristic name="Speed" typeId="25d0e01e-8e74-55b3-8a2a-17773c881625">10″</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Turn" typeId="899e9c58-70ef-5da5-8495-5bf6a8b7f8f0">90°</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Crew" typeId="2f6312dd-493e-53c6-96e2-d901afca0e81">5</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="582ad447-4c9e-588e-8a37-f211d15868d8" name="Assault Ramp" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">In a Hull Assault may commit up to full current Crew, always keeping 1 aboard.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="c4289729-a766-543d-b651-51d44a670ad6" name="Astartes Crew" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Every Crew point aboard counts as Legiones Astartes (+1), free; eligible for Astartes boarding upgrades.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 </profiles>
 <rules><rule id="f6270590-a107-5d3b-99a7-78d5aa6c0841" name="Line" hidden="false"><description>Counts as a Line Ship for every rule that names one, and toward the fleet's Line minimum.</description></rule><rule id="57ce2fc3-8e6c-5c46-ac42-e70307457b6d" name="Reload (X)" hidden="false"><description>After firing, place X Reload tokens on the mount; flip one at the end of each battle round. The mount cannot fire while it bears a token.</description></rule><rule id="c01d118a-6eae-518c-9429-7f56d8e5ed86" name="Devastating (X)" hidden="false"><description>Each hit costs X Hull Points, or 1 Void Shield Rating against live shields.</description></rule><rule id="01d4a564-a02f-5205-9bb2-dcc9dfd8998d" name="Armourbane" hidden="false"><description>Roll 2D6 + Strength to penetrate instead of 1D6, at 6″ or less, against shields or hull alike.</description></rule><rule id="0b5c7b2d-2486-575b-8437-796ab7c67057" name="Point-Blank Broadsides" hidden="false"><description>At 6″ or less, Port, Starboard and Dorsal weapons improve AP by one step — or gain Armourbane instead if their printed AP is already 1. Prow weapons get neither.</description></rule><rule id="690a474c-ecbe-5dac-839f-73176cfd1f37" name="Crippled" hidden="false"><description>Below half starting Hull Points: −1 BS and half Speed.</description></rule><rule id="2a204569-74d6-5cfd-b2b4-5896e93e8749" name="Depleted" hidden="false"><description>At half starting Crew or less: −1 BS. Stacks with Crippled.</description></rule><rule id="29bda89e-80cb-517a-95bb-aea12c3708e3" name="Locked" hidden="false"><description>Joined by a ram. Neither ship may move; the rammer may not fire on its victim, who fires back at −1 BS. Break Away on 5+.</description></rule><rule id="188b49e9-d66a-522c-82fd-5ce6fd6c8686" name="Snap Shots" hidden="false"><description>Firing at BS 1 — hits only on a 6.</description></rule><rule id="e38b4238-eb63-5164-ad3e-54664bfdc95b" name="Wreck" hidden="false"><description>0 Hull Points without exploding. Becomes impassable, obscuring terrain; never moves and never Evades.</description></rule><rule id="0d964a6d-b18d-5f87-8007-d06afec60156" name="Held station" hidden="false"><description>Moved 1″ or less under Burn Retros. Broadsides fire at +1 BS; −1 on Evade.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks>
 <categoryLink id="4befa49c-521c-5b2d-979c-951ab716db59" name="Line" hidden="false" targetId="96572996-e9b1-54a7-a2a9-2108e1dfc993" primary="true" />
 </categoryLinks>
 <selectionEntryGroups>
