 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Named Character. Practised Command: once per battle round, one friendly ship within Command range may re-roll a single failed Evade roll. Friendly ships within 12″ gain +1 BS on Overwatch/Return Fire and may re-roll one failed Repair each turn. Flagship issues 3 Fleet Orders of each type each battle round.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
