 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Primarch. The Fleet Obeys: friendly ships within 12″ ignore the first Critical Damage they would suffer each battle round. Friendly ships within 12″ improve Prow Armour by +1 to max 14. Demigod of War +3.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="adc6df80-650b-4b53-80ad-cff51b7b75f8" name="Primarch Embarkation" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Primarch. 3 Fleet Orders of each type each battle round. The Fleet Obeys: friendly ships within 12″ ignore the first Critical Damage they would suffer each battle round. May only be selected in a 2,000+ point fleet and must ride this Legion's Gloriana as Fleet Commander. Rogal Dorn may instead ride the Phalanx where permitted.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
