 <rules><rule id="517e3e9b-04c2-5936-89d7-b9d41f0df5e9" name="Void Fortress" hidden="false"><description>Imperial Fists only; requires Rogal Dorn; games 3,000+ points. Four 90° broadside facings; one facing fires per Shooting Phase (Defence Batteries excepted). No Stern; cannot suffer Stern Strike. Enemy Damage Table rolls −1; never suffers Crippled −1 BS. Explodes on 5+, radius 3D6″. Hangar Bays (6). Armament fixed.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks>
